      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d1ada46d78ec3ef1cdd9510ee88155f5e796c2530fce51002e960ac7f53033b8--45100do002_2009.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2009\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 3a270c1b4cff565df7c0dae706bde5e67e5626d51a094f7c1aa23704303cac00 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | b3080298fb8b5f202be931daaaac4c5a8afc69282577560e631506b7e523ea4b | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 9fefb6a695aa732576273a0ed39124adbb38cf00e827489bd9bbb355e7efe3cc | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 018593d577903eebb0f78ce70f1f52671fd460c490151a2ffe646ae605878214 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 9fcc132c77c9ae1c995c543691bc6028152c065a5a6d167f4d14c6a4674a551b | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 1026c17284644241fee7bd2ab8c79c754d1749f3166b0d12a7a1b01ab1fde5c8 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 8e8d0931cdc6e916cc40946c7d34b82b89fdced1272be5f3f765a9f192ad3450 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 563634ab3b42f8bd6174e2cc4a16306bf94417f77284aeaa0973ca12ec441ebe | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | bdbce82d1f268c35835f1b5980281fa66b03f1180e3975f768cad504047912b8 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
